{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","科林"],["/names/en","Korin"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名拥有绿裔义肢的战士，能够攻击更远的敌人并造成大量的伤害。"],["/description_i18n/en","A Warrior who has magic arms and is skilled at dealing high damage to ranged enemies."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来吧，你用得上我的枪！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Come on, you'll need my spear."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","战场上磨砺出的经验！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Experience, honed on the battlefield."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","别想逃！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/en","No escaping for you!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","终将，在战场上结束……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Ultimately, it all ends on the battlefield."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","经验是最好的教官"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Experience is the best teacher."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","并肩作战吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Let's stand and fight together!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","我还灵活得很呢。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Phew... Huh, still got the flexibility, ay?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","老伙计啊，这么多年了，只有你还没变。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I will fight to the very end, with my arm, my spear, my very soul!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","我将战斗到最后一刻，凭借这手臂，这枪，这灵魂。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Ah... old friend. You alone are the same, even after all these years."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这东西勾起了我的一些回忆……真怀念以前。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","This thing brings back some memories... reminds me of the old days. Thank you."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我什么也没做，只怕受之有愧。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","I didn't do anything to merit the gift. I'm feeling a bit undeserving."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","休息一下再出发吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's get some rest first before we go."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","肩膀有些酸痛……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","My back feels sore..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来点清淡的吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'd like something light."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这些装饰真是温馨啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","These decorations are just so heartwarming."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来点清淡的吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'd like something light."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","到处都很热闹……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's quite rowdy here..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我也喝一杯吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'll have a drink too."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","科林会经常给藤蔓制成的义肢浇水，进行保养。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Korin regularly waters the vines of his prosthetic limbs to keep them healthy."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","科林能够自如地使用长枪，但因为深知绿裔联盟成员的习俗，他很少在森林中猎取活物。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Korin is exceptionally skilled with his spear but seldom hunts living creatures in the forest out of respect for Wilder customs."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","科林经常梦到失去手臂的那一刻，并从梦中惊醒。而来到薄暮丛林后，他很少再做那样的梦了。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Korin would often have nightmares of losing his arms and would awaken in fright. Ever since arriving in the Dark Forest, however, he has rarely had those dreams."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","由于科林不善言辞，一直想要用别的方式报答达米安，最近在偷偷打听达米安的喜好。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Korin's reticent nature hinders his desire to thank Damian for his help. For that reason, he has been secretly inquiring about Damian's likes and dislikes."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","出人意料的是，科林常在营地后厨帮忙。“不会切到手，”他会这么说，“但是不保证味道。”"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Much to everyone's surprise, Korin is often seen helping in the camp's kitchen. \"I won't cut my hands, but I can't guarantee this will taste good, either,\" he says."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","科林似乎知道很多食谱，不过品相都不太好，充满了军旅时一切从简的风格。然而，尝过的洛桑表示味道相当不错。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Korin seems to know a great number of recipes, though his time in the military has influenced his cooking and made them simple and practical. Even so, Lorsan claims that his food tastes wonderful."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","“大叔看上去有点吓人，但是接触了之后就知道他是个好人！”达米安总是这样向同胞们介绍自己的朋友。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","\"He may look a little scary, but he's actually a really nice guy once you get to know him!\"—Damian's description of his friend, Korin."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","科林睡觉的时候，不会将自己的长枪放在手边一米之外的地方。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Whenever Korin is asleep, his spear is always by his side and within his reach."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","最近科林在试着学习用叶片吹出哨音，不过至今为止，还没有成功过。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Korin has been trying to learn how to play music with leaves recently, but with very little success. \"I've seen some of the young ones do this, but I never got the hang of it. I once saw a young girl do it perfectly near Holistone.\""],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","受救助的难民中有人非常倾慕科林，科林对此了然在心，却还不知道如何回应：“……只是在恰当的时候帮了把手而已。”"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Korin has saved many people in his time, all of whom have expressed their gratitude toward him. However, Korin never knows how to respond: \"I just happened to be in the right place at the right time, that's all...\""],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","你的双手……是藤蔓？"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Your arms... Are they made out of vines?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415706.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415706.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","珀尔修斯 & 科林"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Perseus & Korin"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","经过上次的事件，我感觉，藤蔓这种材质在制作义肢时存在着一些天然的不足！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","After the last incident, I think vines are naturally deficient as components for prosthetics!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415025.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415025.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","达米安 & 科林"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Damian & Korin"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","休息一下再出发吧"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Let's get some rest first before we go."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415066.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415066.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","科林"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Korin"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","来点清淡的吧"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","I'd like something light."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415067.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415067.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","科林"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Korin"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","这些装饰真是温馨啊"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","These decorations are just so heartwarming."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415371.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415371.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","科林"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Korin"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","来点清淡的吧"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","I'd like something light."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415372.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415372.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","科林"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Korin"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","到处都很热闹……"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","It's quite rowdy here..."],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415541.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415541.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","科林"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Korin"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","我也喝一杯吧"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","I'll have a drink too."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415542.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415542.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","科林"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Korin"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","最近肩膀和脖颈的肌肉总是紧绷绷的。"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","My shoulder and neck muscles have been feeling a bit tight lately."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415663.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415663.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","都铎 & 科林"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Thador & Korin"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","要是问我和达米安的相遇……"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","How Damian and I met..."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412020.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412020.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","科林 & 达米安"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Korin & Damian"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","科林大叔，你的手臂是怎么变成现在这样的？满满从来没见过这么严重的伤！"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","Uncle Korin, what happened to your arms? These wounds look pretty severe!"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412080.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412080.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 科林"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Korin"]]}